repository-code: "https://github.com/miladnaderloo/FAIRifyer"
url: "https://github.com/miladnaderloo/FAIRifyer"
abstract: >-
  FAIRifyer turns raw X-ray CT acquisition output into FAIR metadata without
  manual re-entry. It harvests key/value pairs from vendor log files, maps
  vendor vocabularies onto a canonical schema using a curated synonym table
  with a sentence-transformer fallback for unseen keys, normalises units,
  validates against a versioned JSON Schema, and emits both a machine-readable
  record and a deposit-ready README. Developed for the EXCITE2 imaging
  infrastructure.
keywords:
